+):
+    """MOJOLEARN_IDN_MAMBA_BWD_FOLDS: `mamba3_block_norm_backward_kernel`'s
+    per-cell half, one thread per cell, reading the lane + tree row dot from
+    `fold[dot_off + row]`. `rstd` and `correction` are the v1 expressions on
